# Real-world prefill workload shapes pulled from the framework-team CRI benchmark sheet (temp.md).
# All rows are causal per the source sheet. Since no compiled Causal_FixedLen variant exists for
# these CRI tile shapes, the Causal_VarLen class is used with fixed seq_len values instead.
# Weekly run: ALL cases enabled, including the long-running (>10000s) ones excluded from the
# daily config (see daily_bf16_workloads.in).

